/section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20170725211915&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Magical_Music_Notes_2a8dde.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a magical music notes.<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 0.10 oz.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Once used it will have one of 4 possible effects:\n</p>\n<ul><li>Increases your speed by 100 points for 10 minutes;</li>\n<li>Regenerates 490-522 hit points;</li>\n<li>Regenerates 229-270 mana;</li>\n<li>Transforms you into a <a href=\"#/wiki/Faun\">Faun</a> for 10 minutes.</li></ul>\n<p>They expire after 2 hours.\n</p><p><i><b>See also</b>: Magical Music Notes/Statistics</i>\n</p><p>It can be obtained every 20 hours by playing <a href=\"#/wiki/Panpipes\">panpipes</a> while standing on the small island located in the lake on <a href=\"#/wiki/Feyrist\">Feyrist</a>. One is needed during the <a href=\"#/quest/threatened-dreams-quest\">Threatened Dreams Quest</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul class=\"creature-list-generic no-results\"><li>This item is not dropped by any creatures.</li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span 